Yes it's the expected behaviour the call to the method `setQueryParameter` ([actually every changes to the search parameters](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js#automatic-reset-to-page-0)) reset the page automatically. You have to save the page before calling the method then re-apply it after.

```js
{
  searchFunction: function(helper) {
    var query = helper.state.query;
    var page = helper.state.page;

    if (query === "") {
      helper.setQueryParameter("aroundPrecision", 50 * metersInMile);
    } else {
      helper.setQueryParameter("aroundPrecision", 500 * metersInMile);
    }

    helper.setPage(page).search();
  }
};
```
